      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(whatsapp): add chunk-idle timeout to inbound media download",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nFixes an issue where WhatsApp inbound media downloads that stall after Baileys returns a stream (headers/start ok, then no further chunks) would block `downloadInboundMedia` forever via `saveMediaStream`'s unbounded `for await`, so inbound dispatch never produces an agent reply for that message.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\n- Wrap the Baileys AsyncIterable with a local per-chunk idle race (production default `30_000` ms), matching Telegram's download idle floor and the LINE channel pattern (open `#86873`, different owner).\n- On timeout, reject with `WhatsAppInboundMediaTimeoutError`, call `iterator.return()` so Node Readable streams are destroyed, and silence the losing `next()` to avoid `unhandledRejection`.\n- Tests may pass a short `chunkTimeoutMs`; production omits it and uses the 30s floor (proven with fake timers).\n- Does **not** change core `saveMediaStream` / `src/media/store.ts` (avoids competing with LINE `#86873`).\n- Timeout error class stays module-private (knip unused-export gate).\n\nNo new config/env surface.\n\n## User Impact\n\n**Before:** A stalled WhatsApp media body could hang inbound handling for that message indefinitely.\n\n**After:** Idle streams fail closed after 30s with a clear timeout error so the monitor loop can continue.\n\n## Evidence\n\nHead: `d33f273ff5013c6e4f89beb5447b8c28ea41ad53`\n\nExecutable negative control + fix proof:\n\n```bash\nnode scripts/run-vitest.mjs extensions/whatsapp/src/inbound/media.node.test.ts -- --run -t \"chunk-idle|negative\" --reporter=verbose\n```\n\n```text\n[whatsapp media idle negative control] outcome=still-pending wait_ms=150 without_idle_wrap=true\n[whatsapp media idle proof] timed_out=true elapsed_ms=53 chunkTimeoutMs=50 production_ms=30000\n[whatsapp media idle proof] production_default_ms=30000 timed_out=true\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  5 passed | 11 skipped (16)\n```\n\n- **Negative control (executable):** same never-yielding AsyncIterable consumed with bare `for await` (no idle wrap) stays `still-pending` after 150ms — proves the pre-fix hang fixture.\n- **After fix:** `downloadInboundMedia` with `chunkTimeoutMs: 50` rejects in ~53ms; production default advances fake timers to 30s and rejects with `chunkTimeoutMs: 30000`; `iterator.return()` called once on timeout.\n- Touched: `extensions/whatsapp/src/inbound/media.ts` (+ colocated test). Sibling LINE/Telegram idle floors unchanged (different owners).\n\nAI-assisted.\n\n",
        "branch": "fix/whatsapp-inbound-media-chunk-idle",
